65:["$","p","p-59",{"children":["我们总结一下，技术抽象是在实现（How）层面做",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"替换"}],"（",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"MockRepo"}]," 替换 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"MySQLRepo"}],"）。而业务抽象是在逻辑（What）层面做",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"组合"}],"和",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"解耦"}],"，这里我给出了 2 个思路："]}]
66:["$","ul","ul-16",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"策略模式（应对规则）："}]," 当 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"if-else"}]," 开始腐化你的",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"核心算法"}],"时，把",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":["规则 (Rules)",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"抽象成"}],"策略"]}],"，用",["$","strong","strong-3",{"children":"组合"}],"代替",["$","strong","strong-4",{"children":"修改"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"领域事件（应对流程）："}]," 当下游开始污染你的",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"核心职责"}],"时，把",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":["副作用 (Side Effects)",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"抽象成"}],"事件"]}],"，用",["$","strong","strong-3",{"children":"发布/订阅"}],"代替",["$","strong","strong-4",{"children":"直接调用"}],"。"]}],"\n"]}]
