e7:["$","p","p-132",{"children":["它们之间通过",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"存储引擎 API"}]," 这一层来通信。这种分层，使得 MySQL 可以",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"可插拔地"}],"替换存储引擎。",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Query Optimizer"}],"（上层）",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"不"}],"依赖 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"InnoDB"}],"（下层）的实现，它只依赖契约。这就是为什么 MySQL 既可以支持 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"InnoDB"}],"（事务型）也可以支持 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"MyISAM"}],"（非事务型）。"]}]
