18a:["$","p","p-212",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"2. 它是设计权衡的运行时数据"}]}]
18b:["$","p","p-213",{"children":["我们所有的心法（",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"抽象"}],"、",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"分治"}],"、",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"分层"}],"、",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"模块化"}],"）都是有",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"性能代价"}],"的。分层带来了数据复制的代价；模块化带来了网络调用的代价；消息队列（抽象）带来了延迟的代价。"]}]
