1d4:["$","ul","ul-63",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Prompt 即接口"}],"：传统的术是写代码来定义逻辑。全新的术是写 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Prompt"}],"（自然语言）来",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"定义能力和契约"}],"。",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Prompt"}]," 成为了我们与 AI 这个非确定性黑盒交互的",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"新 API"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"编排即分治"}],"：单一 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Prompt"}]," 无法解决复杂问题。因此，术进化为",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"AI 编排"}],"（Orchestration），如 LangChain 或 LlamaIndex 所做的那样。\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"RAG (检索增强生成)"}],"：就是一种编排\"术\"。它将检索和生成这两个步骤分治开来，并通过编排合并结果。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"链式思考 (Chain-of-Thought)"}],"：这是一种引导 AI 分治其内部思维的\"术\"。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"AI 编排层"}],"：在 MLOps 分层中，这一层成为了新的核心。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}]
