1d7:["$","ul","ul-64",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"LLM 即认知引擎"}],"：传统的\"术\"是工程师自顶向下设计一切。Agent \"术\"则将 LLM 视为一个可以",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"自主规划"}],"的认知引擎或中央处理器。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"工具即能力模块"}],"：这对应了\"法\"中的\"模块化\"。",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Agent"}]," 通过工具调用来扩展其能力。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"ReAct 循环"}],"：",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Reason -> Act -> Observe"}]," 的循环，是 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Agent"}]," 架构中最核心的\"术\"，它为 AI 的涌现行为提供了一个可控的执行框架。"]}],"\n"]}]
