1dc:["$","ol","ol-27",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"输入防护"}],"：检查 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Prompt"}]," 是否合规（防注入）。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"输出解析"}],"：强迫 AI 输出 JSON，并进行严格的",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"校验"}],"、",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"pydantic"}]," 风格的类型转换。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"安全过滤"}],"：检查 AI 输出是否有害、有偏见、或包含敏感信息。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"回退机制"}],"：当 AI 失败、超时或输出\"我不知道\"时，",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"回退"}]," 到一个确定的、经典的 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"if-else"}]," 逻辑。"]}],"\n"]}]
