1e3:["$","ul","ul-66",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"传统测试："}]," ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"验证 (Verification)"}],"。其核心是",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"确定性 (Determinism)"}],"。我们要求 1+1 必须等于 2。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"AI 时代的测试："}]," ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"评估 (Evaluation)"}],"。其核心是",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"概率性 (Probabilism)"}]," 和",["$","strong","strong-3",{"children":"模糊性 (Fuzziness)"}],"。我们没有所谓的唯一确定的正确答案，但我们知道它应该是\"简洁的\"、\"忠于原文的\"、\"通顺的\"。"]}],"\n"]}]
